{"path":"cmake/twemoji.cmake","ref":"499076450739a23bece60dc7cdcd09d4828225c8","side":"new","lines":[{"sha":"a74be52f9e1add9dfbe7226e3fd884ba7f29c6f9","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792948932,"line":1,"text":"# Colour emoji images: Twemoji's 72px PNGs, downloaded once at configure time into the gitignored assets/emoji."},{"sha":"a74be52f9e1add9dfbe7226e3fd884ba7f29c6f9","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792948932,"line":2,"text":"set(VITADECK_TWEMOJI_VERSION 17.0.3)"},{"sha":"f13ff8363e8c3283ae051ad25cfc774d7b338181","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792950980,"line":3,"text":"vitadeck_fetch_asset(Twemoji"},{"sha":"f13ff8363e8c3283ae051ad25cfc774d7b338181","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792950980,"line":4,"text":"  URL \"https://github.com/jdecked/twemoji/archive/refs/tags/v${VITADECK_TWEMOJI_VERSION}.zip\""},{"sha":"f13ff8363e8c3283ae051ad25cfc774d7b338181","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792950980,"line":5,"text":"  SHA256 d8a269885d95c78123cc0981c8c76a4c55466cdcb6c7c939434323533e6cd754"},{"sha":"f13ff8363e8c3283ae051ad25cfc774d7b338181","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792950980,"line":6,"text":"  DIR \"${CMAKE_SOURCE_DIR}/assets/emoji\""},{"sha":"f13ff8363e8c3283ae051ad25cfc774d7b338181","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792950980,"line":7,"text":"  FALLBACK \"The build has no emoji images, so emoji draw a fallback glyph.\""},{"sha":"f13ff8363e8c3283ae051ad25cfc774d7b338181","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792950980,"line":8,"text":"  EXTRACT \"twemoji-${VITADECK_TWEMOJI_VERSION}/assets/72x72/*.png\""},{"sha":"f13ff8363e8c3283ae051ad25cfc774d7b338181","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792950980,"line":9,"text":"  # The emoji loader names images with U+FE0F left out."},{"sha":"f13ff8363e8c3283ae051ad25cfc774d7b338181","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792950980,"line":10,"text":"  STRIP \"-fe0f\""},{"sha":"f13ff8363e8c3283ae051ad25cfc774d7b338181","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792950980,"line":11,"text":")"}]}
